msgstr "Réinitialisation"

#: horizon-press-news-bar/includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1544
msgid "I understand that every setting will be restored to its default value."
msgstr "Je comprends que tous les réglages seront restaurés à leur valeur par défaut."

#: horizon-press-news-bar/includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1545
